{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":" 黄海林大师年龄与我相仿，是一位很有前途的大师，曾代表广东队获得04年联赛冠军。\r\n 黑方孙勇征大师是上海队主力成员，只要是经常关注联赛的棋友都熟悉。今年联赛小孙胜率暂时位居第一，是一位非常有实力的强大师。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":" 首局慢棋较量中，黄海林大师抽得先手。至此双方形成中炮对三步虎布局，现在红方抬巡河炮实战中很常见，另一种应法是车一进一，车8进5，双方另有攻守。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d4","comment":" 另一选择是车一进一，以下黑方士4进5，马七进六，马2进1，形成相持局面，红芳保持先手；如寻求复杂可以考虑车8进6，马七进六，车8平7，车九进二，马2进4，炮五退一，车7平8，形成互有顾忌的纠缠之势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h1","comment":" 封锁红方车一进一的线路，由此可以看出红方先车一进一和马七进六的区别之处。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0i1","comment":" 简明的下法，可以形成稍好局面，保持变化也可选择马三退五或士四进五。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i3","comment":" 先取实惠，可行之着，也有马2进3等应法。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3i4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4a4","comment":" 正着，摆脱牵制。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":" 经过一番简化，红方形成稍好局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":" 改走相七进五，黑可考虑卒1进1，士六进五，马1进2，车九平八，马2退3，炮五平二，车1平2，车八进九，马3退2，红